                        "name": "Yuxiao Zhang",
                        "email": "yuxiaozhang@google.com",
                        "username": "zyxiaooo"
                    },
                    "message": "I did a quick experiment, del will still delete the old metrics if there are two metrics, still think it is good to remove it for cleaness\n\nroute_new=\"${route//metric [0-9]*/}\" will also remove the content after metric which is what I don't want to (maybe functional wise is fine but still for cleaness)"
                },
